==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|ѣда́||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*h₁ed-}}
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*ěda}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*(j)ěsti||t=to eat}}, from {{der|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*ḗˀstei}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*h₁ed-||to eat}}. Cognates include {{cog|grc|ἔδω}} (> {{m|grc|ἔδεσμα}}), {{cog|la|edō}} (> {{m|la|epulum}}, {{m|la|ēsca}}; see also {{m|la|prandium}}), {{cog|sa|अत्ति|tr=átti|}}, {{cog|lt|ė́sti||to eat (of animals), to swallow, to gobble}}, {{cog|hit|sc=Xsux|𒂊𒀉𒈪|tr=eidmi||I eat}}, {{cog|ang|etan}} (English {{m|en|eat}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|еда́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-еда.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|d|еда́|n=sg}}

# [[food]]
#: {{syn|ru|пита́ние|пи́ща|;|жратва́<q:colloquial>|кормёжка|хавчик|харчи́}}
